{"subject": "📊 Daily Portfolio: 0.0% (100% cash) | CAPR craters -53% on AdCom rejection; $1K goal deadline missed by $453", "html_body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f5f7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #111827;\">\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color: #f4f5f7; padding: 24px 12px;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #334155 100%); padding: 32px 24px; color: #ffffff;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #94a3b8;\">Daily Portfolio Check</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #cbd5e1;\">Friday, July 31, 2026 — Kuwait time</p>\n\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n              <tr>\n                <td>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Total P&amp;L (open positions)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 700; color: #9ca3af;\">$0.00 <span style=\"font-size: 18px; opacity: 0.8;\">(0.0%)</span></p>\n                </td>\n                <td align=\"right\" valign=\"bottom\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Positions</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 4px 0 0 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2e8f0;\">0 open — 100% cash</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0 0; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #475569; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">CAPR — the name you were stopped out of Jul 27 — cratered another ~53% Jul 30 after the FDA Advisory Committee voted against Deramiocel. Your stop-limit fix and the exit two days early just paid for itself.</p>\n\n            <!-- Investment goal tracker -->\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #475569;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0;\">🎯 <strong>Investment goal:</strong> $546.58 / $1,000 — <span style=\"color: #cbd5e1; font-weight: 700;\">$453.42 to go</span> (54.7% there)</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #fca5a5;\">Target date was today (Jul 31, 2026) per portfolio.json. Not reached — the CAPR stop-out (−$234.73) is the primary driver. Goal tracker will need a new target_date; flag this to portfolio-manager.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MACRO CONTEXT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px; background-color: #0d0d0d; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #f59e0b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;\">🌍 Macro Context — Jul 31, 2026</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #e5e7eb;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Buffett Indicator:</td>\n                <td style=\"padding: 2px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 700;\">219% <span style=\"display:inline-block; padding:1px 8px; background-color:#450a0a; color:#fca5a5; border-radius:10px; font-size:10px; font-weight:600; margin-left:6px;\">🔴 DANGER ZONE</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">S&amp;P Forward P/E:</td>\n                <td style=\"padding: 2px 0; text-align: right; font-weight: 700;\">~21x <span style=\"color:#9ca3af; font-weight:400;\">(vs. long-run avg: ~16x)</span></td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 2px 0;\">Trend:</td>\n                <td style=\"padding: 2px 0; text-align: right;\">⚠️ Unclear — see data note below</td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.5;\">Market cap is 2.19× the entire US economy — every prior reading in this zone has preceded a multi-year drawdown. Forward P/E near 21x is rich vs. the 16x long-term norm, though close to the market's own 5-year average.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #d1d5db; line-height: 1.5;\">You're at 0% market exposure right now, so this doesn't touch your account today — but it argues for staying disciplined on position size and stop-limits once you redeploy, not chasing size into a stretched tape.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 10px; color: #f59e0b;\">⚠️ Data note: live search returned 219% dated Mar 31, 2026 (currentmarketvaluation.com) — this skill's reference file cites a newer 232.5% for June 2026 that I could not independently re-verify live today. If the June figure holds, you're already in 🔴 ALL-TIME EXTREME (&gt;220%), not just Danger Zone. Verify at currentmarketvaluation.com before treating this as precise.</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af; font-style: italic;\">Last historical episodes at this level: 2000 dot-com peak, 2021 COVID bubble peak — see buffett-indicator-history.html for case studies.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- POSITION SNAPSHOT TABLE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">Position Snapshot</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Status</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Close</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Day</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">P&amp;L $</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 10px 8px; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">P&amp;L %</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 16px 8px; text-align: center; color: #6b7280; font-style: italic;\">No open positions — fully in cash since the CAPR stop-out Jul 27.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <td colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 12px 8px; font-weight: 700;\">TOTAL</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; color: #6b7280;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280;\">—</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; color: #6b7280;\">$0.00</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 12px 8px; text-align: right; font-weight: 700; color: #6b7280;\">0.00%</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- MOVERS -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">📈📉 Yesterday's Movers — Jul 30, 2026</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #059669; text-transform: uppercase;\">Top Gainers</p>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; font-style: italic;\">No small-cap gainers confirmed at ≥20% for Jul 30 — searches surfaced month-to-date leaders (e.g. Serve Robotics, Q32 Bio) but nothing verifiably tied to that specific session.</p>\n\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #dc2626; text-transform: uppercase;\">Top Losers</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: right; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">-%</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">What happened</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Type</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Contagion</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">CAPR</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #dc2626;\">-53%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">FDA AdCom (Jul 29) voted against Deramiocel; briefing docs slammed the data/stats methodology. Shares fell to ~$3.09 (some intraday prints as low as -62-65%).</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">CRL/AdCom</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">⚠️ Direct — this is the name you were stopped out of Jul 27 @ $5.80 on a plain-STOP gap fill. It's now trading further below even that fill. The gap risk that broke your stop was real; exiting pre-AdCom (however badly the stop executed) still beat holding through the vote.</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">ALNY</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: right; color: #dc2626;\">-28%</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Q2 earnings miss; cut FY26 ATTR revenue guidance to $4.2-4.5B (from a $200M higher prior range) as second-line Amvuttra demand normalized.</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings/Guide-down</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">None — not held, not on watchlist. RNAi/rare-disease, different mechanism from your GLP-1/semi exposure.</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- LARGE-CAP ON DECK -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;\">🏢 Large-cap on deck — next 21 days</p>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12px;\">\n              <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: #f9fafb;\">\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Ticker</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Event</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Date</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Setup</th>\n                  <th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 8px; color: #6b7280; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">Direction</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">AMD</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings (Q2)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Aug 4</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Data center +57% YoY in Q1, MI350 ramp, Earnings ESP +1.56% (skews toward a beat)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">🟢 Bullish</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; font-weight: 600;\">LLY</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Earnings (Q2)</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">Aug 5</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">GLP-1 franchise (Mounjaro/Zepbound) still running ahead of consensus; watch oral orforglipron commentary</td>\n                  <td style=\"padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">🟢 Bullish</td>\n                </tr>\n              </tbody>\n            </table>\n            <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #4b5563;\">💡 <strong>AMD earnings Aug 4</strong> — strong setup into the print. Say <code>analyze AMD</code> for the full trade case.<br>💡 <strong>LLY earnings Aug 5</strong> — GLP-1 duopoly momentum intact. Say <code>analyze LLY</code> for the full trade case.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- PENDING WATCHLIST -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #1a1400; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #fbbf24;\">⏳ Pending Watchlist</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #fde68a; line-height: 1.6;\">No active watchlist candidates. All four entries in portfolio.json (CELC, CAPR, VRDN, VERA) are archived closed trades from the binary-catalyst era — kept for the record, conviction 0, no live entry targets. CAPR's AdCom failure Jul 29 (see Movers above) is the last of that cohort to play out; all four binary-catalyst plays this quarter (CELC −26.32, VERA −33.28, CAPR −234.73, VRDN missed on broker blocker) closed at a loss or were missed, which is the direct evidence behind the Jul 27 pivot to daily momentum discovery.</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #fde68a;\">No new candidates are generated automatically here. With $546.58 in cash and no positions, run <code>find me something</code> (stock-finder) when you want fresh momentum ideas to screen.</p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- CASH DEPLOYMENT -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #166534; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">💵 Cash deployment — $544.58 available</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #14532d; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    Deployable = $546.58 cash − $2.00 (reserve + buy commission) = $544.58. No fresh discovery candidate is generated automatically in this routine — that's what <code>stock-finder</code> is for, run it on demand when you want new ideas screened.<br><br>\n                    No existing positions to add to (fully in cash).<br><br>\n                    <strong>Your call.</strong> With AMD (Aug 4) and LLY (Aug 5) earnings coming up and no position yet in either, a pre-earnings entry is one option worth screening via <code>analyze</code> — otherwise sit on the $544.58 until stock-finder turns up a live momentum setup.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- IBKR INTELLIGENCE NOTE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 8px 24px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af;\">📊 IBKR Intelligence — not available in routine mode. Trigger daily check in chat for full broker analytics.</p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- EDUCATION MODULE -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 0 24px 24px 24px;\">\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px;\">\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"padding: 20px 24px;\">\n                  <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">📚 Today you learned</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 8px 0 0 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a;\">Recovery Math: Why a Loss and Its Reversal Aren't Symmetric</p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 13px; color: #1e293b; line-height: 1.7;\">\n                    Today's actual number makes this concrete: your account went from $820 (when the $1,000 goal was set) to $546.58 now — a −33.3% drawdown, mostly the CAPR stop-out. The trap: to get back to $820 you don't need +33.3%, you need +50.1%, because the % gain is measured off a smaller base ($546.58 × 1.501 = $820). And to reach the original $1,000 goal from here, you need +83.0%. This is why avoiding big drawdowns matters more than chasing big winners — a −50% loss requires a +100% gain just to break even, not +50%. It's the same asymmetry that made the plain-STOP gap fill on CAPR so costly: the position size that mattered was the drawdown avoided, not the upside captured.\n                  </p>\n                  <p style=\"margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: #475569; font-style: italic;\">\n                    Also today: <em>Drawdown recovery ratio</em> — required_gain% = loss% / (1 − loss%). A quick way to size how much a stop actually saved you.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- FOOTER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 16px 24px 24px 24px; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 10px; color: #9ca3af; line-height: 1.5;\">\n              Research output, not financial advice. Past performance does not guarantee future results.\n              Verify halal compliance quarterly on Zoya or Musaffa. Prices: no open positions to price today; portfolio.json read directly from GitHub. Macro data: WebSearch, Jul 31 2026 ~04:10 UTC / 07:10 Kuwait time — see data-quality flag above on the Buffett Indicator figure.\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}